    <string name="cl_developed_by">Developed by %1$s</string>
    <string name="cl_credits_full">CodeLove is a modified fork of LÖVE for Android, bringing a complete workspace into a single app: folders and files, code editor, game runtime and console.\n\nThe engine that runs games is LÖVE (love2d.org), a free framework for 2D games maintained by the LOVE Development Team and many contributors. CodeLove exists thanks to their work. Thank you!\n\nCodeLove is a modified version and not the original LÖVE. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the LÖVE project.\n\nLÖVE is distributed under the zlib license. The app also uses other free libraries, each with its own license. Tap \"Licenses\" to read the notices.</string>
    <string name="cl_license_fallback">The license file (%1$s) was not found in this app.\n\nLÖVE license: zlib. Copyright (c) 2006-2024 LOVE Development Team. See love2d.org.</string>
